    </style>
        <div id="8EBC0A3C31B74D4D909A5896255D38A9" class="section_container" style="background-color: #FFFFFF; color: #416585" data-anchor-title="Listing with HKEX" title="Listing with HKEX">
            <div class="section_container_in" style="padding-top: 60px; padding-bottom: 30px;">
                    <div class="section_title">
                        <div>
                            Listing with HKEX.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="section_title_line"></div>
                <div class="whylist-landing-richtext">
                    <p class="spanHeading"><span>In 2025, Hong Kong was the #1 IPO venue in the world, with more than</span><span> </span><span>US$36</span><span> billion </span><span>raised by companies from around the world, underlining dynamism and global connectivity of the city&rsquo;s capital markets.</span></p>
<p class="spanHeading"><span>HKEX has p</span><span>roactively and continuously </span><span>enhanced its listing rules to improve market attractiveness in recent years, with new listing rule changes in April 2018 helping establish Hong Kong as a global new economy marketplace.</span></p>
<p class="spanHeading"><span>Since the l</span><span>aunch of new listing chapters in 2018</span><span>, over 430 new economy companies have listed on HKEX, </span><span>raising over </span><span>US$150 billion</span><span>.</span><span> This includes biotech, healthcare and specialist technology companies listed under Chapter 18A and Chapter 18C, reflecting strong investor support for innovation‑driven sectors.</span></p>
<p class="spanHeading"><span>
</span><span>Hong Kong has also hosted many of the world&rsquo;s most significant IPOs in recent years, with two of the five largest IPOs and ECM deals in the world, and eight IPOs of more than US$1 billion in 2025.</span></p>
                    <br />
                        <div id="btn_8EBC0A3C31B74D4D909A5896255D38A9" class="btn_rich_text">
                            <div class="btn_More" style="background-color: #10416c; color:;">View More</div>
                            
                        </div>
                        <div id="MoreContent_8EBC0A3C31B74D4D909A5896255D38A9" class="more_content">
                            <p class="spanHeading"><span>Looking ahead, HKEX</span><span> is </span><span>committed to continuously enhancing its listing rules, regulatory processes and market infrastructure, ensuring </span><span>the attractiveness and competitiveness of </span><span>Hong Kong&nbsp;&ndash;&nbsp;and HKEX &ndash; as listing venue for companies from around the world. </span></p>
<p class="spanHeading"><span>To learn more about our markets, benefits of going public, the IPO process, and the requirements for listing on HKEX, please contact our&nbsp;</span><span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="https://www.hkex.com.hk/Join-Our-Market/IPO/Listing-with-HKEX?sc_lang=en">Global Issuer Services team</a></span><span>.</span></p>
                        </div>
                        <div id="btn_less_8EBC0A3C31B74D4D909A5896255D38A9" class="btn_rich_text">
                            <div class="btn_Less" style="background-color: #fff; color:;"></div>
                            
                        </div>
                </div>
            </div>                           
        </div>
