    <div id="143C59E112E04EF48EA38BB18EBCA8D9" data-anchor-title="Step-by-Step Listing Guide" title="Step-by-Step Listing Guide" class="section_container s5" style="background-image: url('assets/images/s5_bg_pattern_v2.png'), url('/-/media/HKEX_Common/Market/Why-List-in-HK/Whyliststepbystepbg.jpg');">
        <div class="section_container_in more_padding">
            <div class="section_title">
                <div>
                    Step-by-Step Listing Guide
                </div>
            </div>
<div class='section_title_line'></div>            <div class="whylist-landing-richtext">
                <p class="spanHeading"><span>We offer a choice of routes for companies to the Hong Kong markets; and offer our Issuers step-by-step support on the journey to listing. </span></p>
<p style="font-size:28px;"><strong>Main Board</strong></p>
A market for more established companies that satisfy our financial and track record requirements. Companies listed on our Main Board range from conglomerates, banks and property developers to internet companies and healthcare providers. Issuers can choose to list on the Hong Kong Main Board in the form of shares or Hong Kong depository receipts.
<p> </p>
<p style="font-size:28px;"><strong>GEM</strong></p>
<p>
A market for small and mid-sized companies, with less stringent eligibility criteria but similar continuing obligations as the Main Board.</p>
<p><a class="learn_more_btn white w-inline-block" href="/Join-Our-Market/IPO/GEM?sc_lang=en" target="_blank">Learn more</a> <span style="color: red;">&gt;</span><br />
<br />
We know that an IPO is one of the most significant events for any company.&nbsp; We are here, every step of the way:</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
            </div>
